From uf2122b34f1aa6e95 at groups.google.com  Mon Feb 26 10:42:48 2018
From: uf2122b34f1aa6e95 at groups.google.com (Eric Rexstad)
Date: Mon, 26 Feb 2018 10:42:48 +0000
Subject: Re: [distance-sampling] Re: Help to start Survey Design
Message-ID: <pGMGECmLcIU.VDzJynQxAwAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <pGMGECmLcIU.zBhpK4nVAQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
References: <pGMGECmLcIU.o3t2lvFCBAAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com> <pGMGECmLcIU.zBhpK4nVAQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/pGMGECmLcIU/m/VDzJynQxAwAJ>
